{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["於是，我又觀察日光之下的一切欺壓之事。我看見受欺壓的淚流滿面，無人安慰。因為欺壓者有權有勢，所以無人安慰他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因此，我認為那已死的人比活著的人幸福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不過，比以上兩種人更幸運的是那從未出生的人，他們從未見過日光之下的惡行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我又看見人的一切勞碌和成就原是出於爭強好勝。這也是虛空，如同捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愚人遊手好閒，最後只能餓死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["擁有不多，心裡安寧，勝過擁有很多，仍勞碌捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我又看見日光之下一件虛空的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["有一個人孤孤單單，沒有兒子也沒有兄弟，卻終身勞碌。他雖然家道豐裕，仍不滿足，從未想過：「我不停地勞碌，放棄一切享受，究竟是為了誰？」這也是虛空，是一種悲哀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["兩個人總比一個人好，因為二人勞碌同得美好的成果。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["一人跌倒，總有同伴相扶。但孤身一人、跌倒了無人相扶的真悲慘！"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["還有，二人同睡會暖和，一人獨睡怎能暖和呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["遭遇攻擊，一人獨自不能抵擋，二人並肩就能對付。三股擰成的繩子不容易斷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["貧窮但有智慧的青年，勝過年老、愚昧、不再納諫的君王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["雖然這青年在本國出身貧寒，卻能從囚犯成為君王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我看見所有日光之下的人都起來擁護這位代替老君王的青年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["擁護他的人不計其數，以後的世代卻對他不滿。這也是虛空，如同捕風。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}